{"type": "message", "id": "3dd70b1a", "parentId": "88d24f15", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T00:35:57.570Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "toolu_01ChbELQmL7qtUrDstGM7fL2", "toolName": "seg_open", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "case F50 | sequence T2 | shape (i,j,k)=(277, 341, 229) | spacing 1x1x1 mm\ntarget: fibrous soft-tissue tumor\ndisplay: radiological. axial: patient right LEFT, anterior TOP. coronal: patient right LEFT, superior TOP. sagittal: anterior LEFT, superior TOP. R/L cannot be verified for single limbs.\npointing: set-of-marks only. Global marks are integer IDs (3D); edge marks are 'E<n>' valid only in the current view. Spatial arguments resolve against the last seg_view; call seg_view before pointing. Slice indices are navigation.\nlasso/scribble/paint: list mark IDs IN ORDER around the outline (clockwise or counter-clockwise); an out-of-order list self-intersects and fills with holes.\nbudgets: 40 tool calls, 15 model prompts (exhausted -> call seg_finish).\naxial 114/229 | crop full | marks none | overlay none | v0 | tool calls 1/40, prompts 0/15"}, {"type": "image", "omitted": true, "mimeType": "image/png", "sha256": "ce8ec44002ddb9d596c8d33a56bd74974fee7144179ec47fc87d32ef99d4c76a", "bytes": 346020}], "details": {"op": "open", "ok": true, "done": false}, "isError": false, "durationMs": 789, "timestamp": 1792370157570}}
